            <ArticleTitle>Bilateral patellar metastases as the clinical presentation of bronchogenic adenocarcinoma.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>939-41</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Common symptoms of the musculoskeletal system may occur as a rare presentation of an underlying malignancy. We describe a case of bronchogenic adenocarcinoma presenting as bilateral knee pain with arthritis due to bilateral metastases to the patellae. We also review the literature of patellar metastases.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
